    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The silence is heavy. It's almost more than I can bear. I look at my sword, the very blade that was supposed to protect this kingdom, and it's the only thing that feels real anymore. It’s the only constant. Everything else is just ghosts. It’s like the steel is the only thing that actually understands the end of my story.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
