    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's so much more honest than any word anyone ever said to me. A way out of the noise. There's just this pull towards it... like the only way to truly honor what was lost is to go where the silence is absolute. To just let the story reach its final conclusion here, in the dark.",
